Z||000000||camon||10-16-2001||09:41 PM||||Finally got those pics of my $1000.00 87 GT how do I post them?<P>Got them scanned and ready to post and would like to know how I can get them on here.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||SLYGUY||10-16-2001||09:46 PM||||Very easy thing to do, just a couple of steps is all. Scan them and have them stored on your computer in a place that is easy to find. Go to <A HREF="http://www.printroom.com" TARGET=_blank>www.printroom.com</A>  and open an account. There are two different ways to "upload" your images into your account. Both are pretty easy. Open up a second browser. Start your topic. While your topic is still open go to your image(s) in your still open printroom browser. There will be a small box with your image's URL. Highlight the entire URL. <BR>Go back to your posted topic in PFF.<BR>Where you want your picture to be type:<P>[img] paste the URL here [/img]<P>That should do it.<BR>Good luck  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Sly||||reg||1
